<https://w3id.org/mailo#Amend_AIAct_v3b_Omnibus_AnnexI_SaMD> <https://w3id.org/mailo#amendmentDescription> "Omnibus VII provisional agreement — Annex I systems (AI embedded in regulated products including medical devices): 2028-08-02. Single joint MDR+AI Act notified body assessment pathway available. Art.9/10/13/14/43 high-risk obligations apply by this date." .
