<https://w3id.org/mailo#EHDS_Art75> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HealthData@EU connects national contact points for secondary use, enabling EU-wide access to datasets through a single channel without raw data transfer. Not to be confused with MyHealth@EU (Art.23), the corresponding infrastructure for primary use. Third-country participation becomes possible under Art.75(5) from 26 March 2035. Renumbered in v5.1.0: previously recorded as Art.50, which is COM(2022) 197 proposal numbering."@en .
