<https://w3id.org/mailo#DataAct_Art4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Art.4(6)-(8) limit the data-holder's access obligation where disclosure would reveal a protected trade secret, permitting withholding or refusal on a substantiated basis. The parallel limitation for third-party sharing is Art.5(9)-(11), and for B2G disclosure Art.19(2) and Art.21. Key tension with AI transparency obligations. Corrected in v5.1.0 Round 5: previously recorded as Art.15, which defines exceptional need for B2G access and says nothing about trade secrets."@en .
