<https://w3id.org/mailo#OmnibusAI_ProvisionalAgreement_20260507> <https://w3id.org/mailo#amendmentDescription> "Provisional political agreement on Digital Omnibus on AI (Omnibus VII package). Extends Annex III standalone high-risk deadline to 2027-12-02 and Annex I (SaMD/MDR) deadline to 2028-08-02 via conditional standards-availability mechanism. Introduces unified MDR+AI Act notified body assessment pathway. Not yet formally adopted as of 2026-05-10; formal adoption expected before 2026-08-02. Source: Consilium press release 2026-05-07." .
