<https://w3id.org/mailo#P_817_004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pre-determined assessment criteria may in no circumstances be based on health (PNR Directive Art.6(4); C-817/19 paras 105, 196-197) — a categorical prohibition, not a special-category rule curable by a GDPR Art.9(2) basis. MAILO transposes this to medical AI as a bar on using health condition as a discriminatory classification or risk-scoring criterion, which is narrower than any processing of health data."@en .
