<https://w3id.org/mailo#PendingAmendment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A proposed but not yet adopted amendment to a legislative provision encoded in MAILO. MAILO encodes the numbering of the text currently in force; a PendingAmendment records, separately and explicitly, that a legislative proposal would change or delete that provision. The two are kept apart deliberately: encoding proposal numbering as though it were in force is the failure mode that produced the EHDS renumbering errors corrected in v5.1.0 Round 3."@en .
