<https://w3id.org/mailo#Risk_EHDSOptOut> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Widespread exercise of opt-out rights under EHDS Art.35 may substantially reduce available health data for AI training, creating representativeness risk under AI Act Art.10."@en .
