<https://w3id.org/mailo#EHDS_Art71> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Natural persons may opt out of the processing of their personal electronic health data for secondary use. GDPR supervisory authorities are competent for monitoring and enforcing this right. Creates tension with AI Act Art.10 data governance obligations, since opt-out reduces dataset representativeness. Renumbered in v5.1.0: previously recorded as Art.35, which is COM(2022) 197 proposal numbering."@en .
