<https://w3id.org/mailo#DigitalOmnibus_DataAct_ChapterV> <https://w3id.org/mailo#proposedEffect> "Deletes Data Act Arts 14 and 15 and consolidates the business-to-government regime into a new Art.15a, narrowing the trigger from 'exceptional need' to public emergencies only. Not adopted as at the verification date: the AI limb of the Digital Omnibus was severed and adopted separately as Regulation (EU) 2026/1744, while the data limb remains in negotiation. MAILO therefore continues to encode the numbering of Regulation (EU) 2023/2854 as published."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#GDPR_Art22_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Exceptions: contract necessity, explicit consent, EU/Member State law."@en .
